[size=6][b]Group & Activity Finder Extensions[/b][/size]

Enhances the Group & Activity Finder with quality-of-life improvements for daily pledges, trials, battlegrounds, and more. Designed for keyboard-friendly navigation and reduced clicking.

[size=5][b]Compatibility[/b][/size]

[size=4][b]Master Merchant[/b][/size]

If you have Master Merchant installed with "Replace Inventory Values" enabled, the TTC Price Display feature will be automatically disabled. Master Merchant's price display takes precedence to avoid conflicts. To use this addon's TTC prices instead, disable "Replace Inventory Values" in Master Merchant's settings.

[size=5][b]Dependencies[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][url=https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info7-LibAddonMenu.html]LibAddonMenu-2.0[/url]
[*][url=https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info4349-LibPanicida.html]LibPanicida[/url]
[*][url=https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info2625-LibQuestData.html]LibQuestData[/url]
[*][url=https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info2161-LibSavedVars.html]LibSavedVars[/url]
[*][url=https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info1151-LibScroll.html]LibScroll[/url]
[*][url=https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info3946-LibUndauntedPledges.html]LibUndauntedPledges[/url]
[/list]

[size=5][b]Features[/b][/size]

[size=4][b]Dungeon Finder Enhancements[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Pledge Tracking[/b]: See which daily pledges you've completed directly in the dungeon finder
[*][b]Smart Queue Buttons[/b]: Queue for dungeons based on:
[list]
[*]Incomplete pledges
[*]Missing dungeon quests
[*]Missing item set collection pieces
[*]Random dungeons at appropriate difficulty
[/list]
[*][b]Auto-Collapse[/b]: Automatically collapses Normal/Veteran dungeon lists based on your preference or current group difficulty
[/list]

[size=4][b]Trial Tracking[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Track trial quest completion status
[*]Monitor weekly chest availability with 7-day lockout timers
[*]View trial information directly in the activity finder
[/list]

[size=4][b]Battleground Tracking[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Track daily battleground reward eligibility
[*]View completion status in the activity schedule
[/list]

[size=4][b]Activity Schedule Panel[/b][/size]

A dedicated panel accessible from the Group & Activity Finder showing:

[list]
[*]Daily activity completion status
[*]Pledge quest progress
[*]Trial availability and chest timers
[/list]

[size=4][b]Queue Improvements[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Queue Timer[/b]: See how long you've been waiting in queue
[*][b]Auto-Accept Ready Check[/b]: Optionally auto-accept when a group is found (with configurable delay)
[*][b]Sound Loop[/b]: Looping notification sound while waiting for ready checks
[/list]

[size=4][b]Quest Automation[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Auto-accept pledge quests from Undaunted NPCs
[*]Auto-complete and turn in pledges after dungeon completion
[*]Skip repetitive quest dialogue for daily content
[/list]

[size=4][b]Map & Fast Travel[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Quick-travel buttons to major alliance cities on the world map
[*]Set a favorite fast travel location accessible via hotkey
[/list]

[size=4][b]Armory Build Display[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Shows your currently active armory build on the character panel (Requires you to interact with the armory system to initialize. Just save or restore any build to get started)
[/list]

[size=4][b]Currency Tracker[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Displays daily currency gains next to each currency in the Inventory Wallet
[*]Tracks gold, Alliance Points, Tel Var Stones, and other currencies
[*]Positive gains shown in green
[*]Automatically resets at daily reset
[*]Bank deposits/withdrawals are excluded from tracking
[/list]

[size=4][b]Crafted Item Indicator[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Displays a crafted icon on player-crafted items in inventory
[*]Works in backpack, bank, and craft bag
[/list]

[size=4][b]Group Unit Frame Enhancements[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Level Display[/b]: Shows player level or Champion Points directly on group unit frames
[list]
[*]Displays below the player name on both small group and raid frames
[*]Automatically fades when group members are out of support range
[*]Updates dynamically on level-ups and Champion Point changes
[/list]
[*][b]User ID Preference Support[/b]: When "Prefer User ID" is enabled in ESO settings, the group list displays account names instead of character names
[list]
[*]Hover over a group member to see their character name in a tooltip
[/list]
[/list]

[size=4][b][i](Optional)[/i] Tamriel Trade Centre Price Display[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Requires Tamriel Trade Centre to be installed.
[*]Replaces vendor sell prices with Tamriel Trade Centre market prices in inventory
[list]
[*]White: Not on TTC
[*]Green: < 5k
[*]Blue: 5k-20k
[*]Purple: 20k-100k
[*]Gold: > 100k
[/list]
[*]Compatible with backpack, bank, and craft bag
[/list]

[size=5][b]Slash Commands[/b][/size]

[code]
Command   | Description
----------|--------------------------------------------------
/qp       | Queue for dungeons with incomplete pledges in your journal
/qq       | Queue for dungeons with incomplete quests
/qs       | Queue for dungeons with incomplete item set collections
/qd       | Queue for a random dungeon
/qb       | Queue for a random battleground
[/code]

[size=5][b]AI Assistance Notice[/b][/size]

This addon was developed with the assistance of AI coding tools. All code has been reviewed and tested by human developers to ensure proper functionality within ESO.
